flowchart TD
    START --> Planner[Planner Agent<br/>~8s]
    
    Planner --> Decision{Routing Decision}
    
    Decision -->|Fast Path| Final1[Final Decision Agent<br/>~10s]
    Decision -->|Medium Path| Claim1[Claim Extractor<br/>~8s]
    Decision -->|Full Path| Claim2[Claim Extractor<br/>~8s]
    
    Claim1 --> Metrics1[Metric Fusion Agent<br/>2 calls in parallel<br/>~25s]
    Claim2 --> Metrics2[Metric Fusion Agent + Evidence<br/>3 calls in parallel<br/>~35s]
    
    Metrics1 --> Final2[Final Decision Agent<br/>~10s]
    Metrics2 --> Final2
    
    Final1 --> END
    Final2 --> END